<title>USA: Unit Corp unit purchases drilling rigs.</title>
<headline>Unit Corp unit purchases drilling rigs.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unit Corp said Monday its Unit Drilling Co unit purchased two rigs, approximately 36,000 feet of drill pipe and drill collars, and some associated equipment from Universal Resources Corp for $1.7 million.</p>
<p>Unit said the purchase brings its active drilling rig fleet to 24.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
